WEBVTT

00:03.550 --> 00:09.300
<b>The adventures of Hajime and me, along 
with our other happy friends, continue.</b>

00:10.760 --> 00:13.950
<b>The desert was hot. Boy, was it hot.</b>

00:14.290 --> 00:17.960
<b>The Gruen Volcano Labyrinth was even hotter.</b>

00:18.580 --> 00:23.750
<b>Then, suddenly, a male demon 
appeared and hurt my dear Hajime.</b>

00:24.010 --> 00:25.650
<b>I will never forgive him.</b>

00:26.490 --> 00:27.880
<b>Myu is so cute.</b>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.320
<b>We stopped by the city of Erisen,</b>

00:30.320 --> 00:33.550
<b>where Myu was reunited 
with her mother, Remia.</b>

00:33.800 --> 00:36.250
<b>Wonderful. Truly wonderful.</b>

00:36.250 --> 00:38.220
<b>I want kids too.</b>

00:38.980 --> 00:44.390
<b>The submarine heads towards 
the Sunken Ruins of Melusine.</b>

00:44.840 --> 00:48.880
<b>After we got through it, we got hit 
by a huge underwater explosion.</b>

00:49.310 --> 00:53.940
<b>I wonder if Hajime and Shea's friend is okay?</b>

00:55.420 --> 00:57.730
<b>Myu really got stronger.</b>

00:58.060 --> 01:02.620
<b>We promised her we would 
come back, and left Erisen.</b>

01:02.620 --> 01:04.490
<b>We met with Liliana who told us</b>

01:04.490 --> 01:06.950
<b>about the danger looming 
over the kingdom of Heiligh.</b>

01:07.810 --> 01:10.640
<b>The danger was an attack by the demons.</b>

01:11.130 --> 01:13.710
<b>That guy who hurt Hajime was there.</b>

01:14.210 --> 01:18.010
<b>I think Hajime fought some girl 
claiming to be a god's apostle.</b>

01:19.090 --> 01:22.800
<b>Aiko and Tio blew something up.</b>

01:23.910 --> 01:27.440
<b>I heard that he was really 
surprised by Hajime's power.</b>

01:27.760 --> 01:29.010
<b>Of course.</b>

01:29.710 --> 01:33.450
<b>When I arrived, the demon 
had already ran off,</b>

01:33.450 --> 01:36.850
<b>taking one of Hajime's classmates with him.</b>

01:38.770 --> 01:41.820
<b>Kaori died and came back to life.</b>

01:43.190 --> 01:46.950
<b>And now, we're headed towards 
the Haltsina Sea of Trees.</b>

01:47.330 --> 01:50.270
<b>Only two more Great Labyrinths to go.</b>

01:50.270 --> 01:54.910
<b>I want to wrap it up quickly to work with 
Hajime on making our dream come true.</b>

01:56.070 --> 01:57.510
<b>What are you doing?</b>

01:59.740 --> 02:00.630
<b>Yue?</b>

02:05.200 --> 02:06.410
<b>It's a secret.</b>

03:36.980 --> 03:42.030
<b>Episode 01: Haulias Assemble</b>

03:49.450 --> 03:53.250
<b>Princess, you want us to drop you off 
near the Empire's border, right?</b>

03:53.250 --> 03:56.170
<b>Yes, thank you for your help.</b>

03:56.170 --> 03:59.210
<b>Oh, right. Lily is on a different mission.</b>

03:59.760 --> 04:02.470
<b>You're going to go meet the emperor 
of the Hoelscher Empire, right?</b>

04:02.800 --> 04:06.600
<b>Wow, the Empire, huh? I'd 
like to visit someday.</b>

04:06.600 --> 04:08.100
<b>Don't, Kaori.</b>

04:09.100 --> 04:11.480
<b>Nagumo-san is right.</b>

04:11.770 --> 04:13.560
<b>They are humans like us,</b>

04:13.560 --> 04:16.310
<b>but as a nation, they couldn't 
be more different from Heiligh.</b>

04:16.310 --> 04:17.650
<b>Are they really so different?</b>

04:19.480 --> 04:21.990
<b>The Hoelscher Empire is a 
military nation made by</b>

04:21.990 --> 04:24.490
<b>a gathering of powerful 
mercenaries and adventurers.</b>

04:24.490 --> 04:26.820
<b>They assert a form of meritocracy 
based on strength -</b>

04:26.820 --> 04:29.870
<b>kill all enemies, take 
what you want with force,</b>

04:29.870 --> 04:32.250
<b>the weak must obey the strong.</b>

04:32.790 --> 04:37.420
<b>They will use anything they find useful, 
including prisoners of war or slaves.</b>

04:37.710 --> 04:40.880
<b>By slaves, you mean beastmen.</b>

04:42.380 --> 04:44.720
<b>That's quite different from 
the Kingdom of Heiligh.</b>

04:44.720 --> 04:48.350
<b>Yeah. Heiligh is a nice 
place with no racism.</b>

04:48.550 --> 04:51.060
<b>No, that's not accurate.</b>

04:51.060 --> 04:56.560
<b>Beastmen who have no magic power are 
considered an evil race abandoned by god.</b>

04:56.560 --> 05:00.020
<b>They are hated and discriminated 
against, to be honest.</b>

05:00.230 --> 05:01.070
<b>Oh...</b>

05:05.740 --> 05:07.360
<b>Princess of Heiligh,</b>

05:08.320 --> 05:10.910
<b>Shea isn't personally angry with you.</b>

05:11.200 --> 05:15.250
<b>It's just that, it seems like she ran 
into some imperial soldiers before.</b>

05:15.580 --> 05:17.620
<b>I see. I might be able to help in some way.</b>

05:17.620 --> 05:23.760
<b>If it's not too much trouble, can 
you tell me about what happened?</b>

05:25.510 --> 05:27.050
<b>Why don't you tell her?</b>

05:28.260 --> 05:33.770
<b>Yes. This was a bit before I 
met Hajime-san and Yue-san.</b>

05:41.190 --> 05:45.240
<b>When we got chased out of Verbergen 
and exited the forest,</b>

05:45.240 --> 05:47.660
<b>a band of imperial soldiers found us.</b>

05:48.700 --> 05:52.660
<b>Many members of my family 
were killed or taken away.</b>

05:57.080 --> 06:00.540
<b>Then, on top of that, we got 
attacked by monsters...</b>

06:03.300 --> 06:04.960
<b>It was my fault...</b>

06:05.510 --> 06:07.090
<b>It's not your fault, Shea.</b>

06:07.260 --> 06:10.930
<b>Indeed. It's the laws of 
Verbergen that's wrong,</b>

06:10.930 --> 06:13.760
<b>that say beastmen with magic 
powers must be killed.</b>

06:14.060 --> 06:17.020
<b>And the Empire that take 
beastmen away as slaves.</b>

06:17.020 --> 06:21.810
<b>Shea-san, when I get to the Empire, I'll try 
to find out what happened to your family.</b>

06:22.520 --> 06:25.650
<b>It might be hard to find them, but...</b>

06:26.820 --> 06:27.820
<b>Right!</b>

06:28.530 --> 06:29.570
<b>Kouki?</b>

06:30.240 --> 06:32.740
<b>Nagumo! The Great Labyrinth can wait!</b>

06:33.030 --> 06:34.870
<b>Let's go save the beastmen!</b>

06:35.200 --> 06:39.330
<b>In this world, the enslaving 
of beastmen is commonplace.</b>

06:40.290 --> 06:43.090
<b>It's not our place as otherworlders 
to stick our necks</b>

06:43.090 --> 06:44.880
<b>in without really knowing what we're doing.</b>

06:45.750 --> 06:48.880
<b>If you still want to, then you can go ahead.</b>

06:51.590 --> 06:53.050
<b>I won't stop you.</b>

07:10.530 --> 07:11.530
<b>Kouki.</b>

07:13.700 --> 07:14.950
<b>Nice weather.</b>

07:17.200 --> 07:20.750
<b>He can make this crazy powerful thing, 
and is super powerful himself.</b>

07:21.330 --> 07:23.670
<b>Then why is he so calm about all of this?</b>

07:24.670 --> 07:26.840
<b>How can he so easily give up on them?</b>

07:27.500 --> 07:29.510
<b>You mean the beastmen?</b>

07:29.510 --> 07:32.470
<b>Every person living in this world, too!</b>

07:33.510 --> 07:35.720
<b>He knows the truth regarding their god.</b>

07:36.680 --> 07:37.850
<b>Kouki...</b>

07:40.140 --> 07:41.770
<b>I suppose he made a choice.</b>

07:42.480 --> 07:43.480
<b>A choice?</b>

07:43.940 --> 07:47.480
<b>I don't think he's as relaxed as he appears.</b>

07:48.150 --> 07:53.110
<b>I think he acts calm, but is 
actually always desperate.</b>

07:53.610 --> 07:54.620
<b>Shizuku...</b>

07:55.120 --> 07:58.120
<b>He's desperately trying to survive 
with the people he holds dear.</b>

07:59.450 --> 08:01.210
<b>He told you before, right?</b>

08:01.210 --> 08:04.080
<b>About how he doesn't achieve 
things because he has power,</b>

08:04.080 --> 08:07.250
<b>but that he gained power in order to 
be able to achieve something specific.</b>

08:09.840 --> 08:14.590
<b>The power you feel in him right now 
isn't something he started with.</b>

08:15.140 --> 08:17.510
<b>He was called useless and worthless,</b>

08:17.510 --> 08:20.270
<b>and crawled up from the 
bottom to get that power.</b>

08:21.270 --> 08:24.600
<b>Not to defeat a god, not to save a world,</b>

08:25.150 --> 08:27.610
<b>but for something much more 
specific and personal.</b>

08:28.860 --> 08:32.030
<b>He doesn't do things because 
he can, like we do.</b>

08:32.440 --> 08:35.820
<b>That's why you can't convince 
him by asking him to do</b>

08:35.820 --> 08:37.660
<b>something just because he can.</b>

08:38.280 --> 08:41.660
<b>Because, after all, that's not 
what he gained his powers for.</b>

08:41.950 --> 08:43.370
<b>You say that, but...</b>

08:47.000 --> 08:48.290
<b>We're changing course?</b>

08:48.290 --> 08:49.290
<b>Let's get back inside!</b>

08:53.760 --> 08:54.930
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

08:54.930 --> 08:59.220
<b>Yeah. It seems like someone is 
being chased by imperial soldiers.</b>

09:04.770 --> 09:09.060
<b>That's a carriage the Empire 
uses to transport slaves!</b>

09:09.230 --> 09:10.730
<b>We have to go save them now!</b>

09:12.610 --> 09:13.780
<b>Hey, Nagumo!</b>

09:14.150 --> 09:16.450
<b>You're not going to abandon them, are you?!</b>

09:16.450 --> 09:18.910
<b>If you're not going to save them, I will!</b>

09:18.910 --> 09:20.080
<b>Wait a sec.</b>

09:21.290 --> 09:23.700
<b>Hey Shea, aren't they...</b>

09:27.370 --> 09:29.630
<b>Huh? Oh, these two!</b>

09:30.250 --> 09:32.920
<b>Hajime-san! It's definitely them!</b>

09:32.920 --> 09:34.920
<b>That's Lana-san and Mina-san!</b>

09:34.920 --> 09:36.340
<b>I knew it.</b>

09:36.340 --> 09:40.010
<b>I couldn't get them out of my memory 
because of how drastically they changed.</b>

09:43.270 --> 09:44.390
<b>This is bad!</b>

09:44.890 --> 09:46.810
<b>Don't worry, Amanogawa.</b>

09:46.810 --> 09:48.600
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

09:48.600 --> 09:51.520
<b>Those frail women are about to be assaulted!</b>

09:51.520 --> 09:55.400
<b>Frail? No way. They're Haulia.</b>

09:55.400 --> 09:56.320
<b>Huh?</b>

10:04.500 --> 10:08.290
<b>They're luring the imperials in on purpose.</b>

10:08.790 --> 10:10.790
<b>W-What's going on?!</b>

10:18.090 --> 10:22.550
<b>Hey! What is this?! What happened?!</b>

10:23.760 --> 10:25.810
<b>Dammit, speak!</b>

10:36.820 --> 10:39.240
<b>These are really rabbit beastmen...?</b>

10:39.820 --> 10:41.240
<b>Seriously?</b>

10:41.990 --> 10:43.740
<b>Rabbits are scary...</b>

10:44.030 --> 10:48.370
<b>Are all rabbit beastmen like Shea-san...?</b>

10:48.620 --> 10:52.880
<b>No, in their case, that's 
just hard training.</b>

10:53.170 --> 10:55.380
<b>Training?</b>

10:55.630 --> 11:01.140
<b>Yes. They became that way through 
Hajime-san's training - some might even call it</b>

11:01.140 --> 11:03.300
<b>an otherworldly transformation.</b>

11:46.010 --> 11:47.180
<b>No--</b>

12:02.530 --> 12:04.530
<b>Long time no see, boss!</b>

12:09.910 --> 12:11.540
<b>H-How did you know?</b>

12:11.540 --> 12:14.540
<b>Nagumo-kun, do you have psychic powers too?</b>

12:15.000 --> 12:17.540
<b>If it was a physical attack, 
I wouldn't have noticed,</b>

12:18.210 --> 12:21.970
<b>but I can know when anyone 
tries to use magic.</b>

12:21.970 --> 12:24.390
<b>That wasn't just for show?!</b>

12:24.390 --> 12:26.600
<b>I thought you had questionable tastes.</b>

12:26.600 --> 12:29.260
<b>I thought it was a bold fashion statement.</b>

12:29.560 --> 12:32.430
<b>I was like, why wear an 
eyepatch for no reason?</b>

12:32.850 --> 12:34.270
<b>Oh, that too!</b>

12:35.900 --> 12:38.020
<b>Who are you calling edgelord?!</b>

12:39.320 --> 12:43.280
<b>Ow! My butt! My butt!</b>

12:57.250 --> 13:03.300
<b>Hey, Shizu-shizu, I've seen the 
look on those beastmen's faces.</b>

13:04.130 --> 13:06.470
<b>It's the look on the Earthlings</b>

13:06.470 --> 13:10.510
<b>when they watch aliens descend 
from their spacecraft.</b>

13:10.510 --> 13:14.810
<b>Wait, Suzu, does that make us the aliens?</b>

13:14.980 --> 13:18.060
<b>Aliens? I am dragonborn.</b>

13:18.480 --> 13:21.650
<b>An encounter with the unknown, right.</b>

13:25.740 --> 13:30.120
<b>Boss! We were dreaming of the day 
to be able to see you again!</b>

13:30.120 --> 13:33.580
<b>I didn't expect you to arrive 
on such a vehicle, though.</b>

13:33.580 --> 13:35.120
<b>Long time no see.</b>

13:35.120 --> 13:37.580
<b>I am astonished!</b>

13:37.580 --> 13:40.590
<b>Also, thank you for your help earlier!</b>

13:40.880 --> 13:45.630
<b>Yeah. It might not have been needed, 
though, seeing how you move.</b>

13:46.090 --> 13:48.260
<b>You've gotten stronger.</b>

13:50.760 --> 13:53.020
<b>It is a great honor, sir!</b>

13:57.980 --> 14:00.940
<b>I'm glad everyone seems healthy.</b>

14:00.940 --> 14:03.610
<b>By the way, where is my 
father and the others?</b>

14:03.900 --> 14:05.820
<b>Is this the whole group, Par?</b>

14:05.820 --> 14:10.160
<b>Besides, why are you fighting 
the imperials way out here?</b>

14:10.160 --> 14:12.450
<b>It's a long, complicated story.</b>

14:12.450 --> 14:15.700
<b>Let's settle down somewhere 
to discuss the details.</b>

14:16.500 --> 14:17.500
<b>Also, sister.</b>

14:17.870 --> 14:21.290
<b>My name is no longer Par. It 
is Baltfeld the Executioner.</b>

14:21.840 --> 14:23.210
<b>The Executioner...?</b>

14:23.210 --> 14:26.420
<b>Yes. Please remember that.</b>

14:27.840 --> 14:28.800
<b>Lana-san--</b>

14:28.800 --> 14:30.090
<b>Shea, it's not Lana.</b>

14:30.890 --> 14:33.100
<b>I am Lanainferina the Swift Gale!</b>

14:34.720 --> 14:36.520
<b>Lana-san?! You too?</b>

14:37.100 --> 14:39.480
<b>I am Minasteria the Skybreaker!</b>

14:40.520 --> 14:43.520
<b>I am Neashutatrum of the External Murder!</b>

14:44.020 --> 14:46.530
<b>I am Yaozelius the Phantom!</b>

14:46.530 --> 14:48.700
<b>I am Yorgandr the Silent Blade!</b>

14:52.450 --> 14:55.450
<b>By the way, boss, which do you prefer,</b>

14:55.450 --> 14:58.500
<b>"Red Rondo of Death" or 
"White Fang Hurricane"?</b>

14:59.000 --> 15:00.040
<b>What?</b>

15:00.290 --> 15:05.000
<b>Your nickname. Our whole tribe 
spent ten whole days debating it,</b>

15:05.000 --> 15:07.920
<b>and was finally able to bring 
it down to these two choices.</b>

15:07.920 --> 15:11.300
<b>But we could never decide which...</b>

15:11.800 --> 15:12.680
<b>Huh?</b>

15:12.680 --> 15:16.970
<b>We decided it would be best to have the 
boss himself pick, when we see him again.</b>

15:17.350 --> 15:20.480
<b>By the way, I'm on team 
"Red Rondo of Death"!</b>

15:20.480 --> 15:25.570
<b>Wait, why is it assumed that I 
will have a nickname at all?</b>

15:25.770 --> 15:29.570
<b>Boss, I am definitely in support 
of "White Fang Hurricane".</b>

15:29.570 --> 15:31.490
<b>Please, listen, I--</b>

15:31.490 --> 15:34.240
<b>What are you talking about, 
Lanainferina the Swift Gale?</b>

15:34.240 --> 15:38.500
<b>"Red Rondo of Death" is the best 
match for the boss, no doubt!</b>

15:38.500 --> 15:39.830
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

15:39.540 --> 15:41.920
<b>Hey, enough already--</b>

15:39.830 --> 15:41.290
<b>"Rondo" all the way.</b>

15:41.290 --> 15:41.920
<b>No.</b>

15:42.210 --> 15:45.880
<b>That's right! The way he lets 
crimson magic power and sparks fly</b>

15:45.880 --> 15:50.300
<b>as he acrobatically wields multiple 
weapons while flying around!</b>

15:50.300 --> 15:52.840
<b>That's definitely a "Red Rondo of Death"!</b>

15:52.840 --> 15:54.930
<b>Stop! The detailed explanation 
makes it worse!</b>

15:54.930 --> 15:57.770
<b>Wait, Neashutatrum of the External Murder!</b>

15:57.770 --> 16:01.480
<b>You fail to recognize the 
trademark white hair...</b>

16:01.480 --> 16:05.560
<b>And the dual-wielding weapons, which can 
only be described as the fangs of a beast king.</b>

16:05.560 --> 16:09.610
<b>There is no way to describe that 
other than "White Fang Hurricane"!</b>

16:09.610 --> 16:11.570
<b>Why don't you get it?!</b>

16:12.070 --> 16:15.410
<b>Shizu-shizu, you can't laugh...</b>

16:16.240 --> 16:21.460
<b>You too... Is edgelording contagious?</b>

16:24.960 --> 16:28.130
<b>Yaegashi, since you're so cool,</b>

16:28.130 --> 16:31.420
<b>I'm forcing you to wear twin 
tails and a ribbon later.</b>

16:32.090 --> 16:36.640
<b>Taniguchi, I'll shave 
off 5cm of your height.</b>

16:39.060 --> 16:42.850
<b>Look forward to that, you two.</b>

16:55.740 --> 16:58.870
<b>So, what brings you all out here?</b>

16:59.700 --> 17:03.120
<b>Seeing how so many beastmen were kidnapped,</b>

17:03.120 --> 17:06.250
<b>does that mean the Empire reached 
that far into the forest?</b>

17:06.540 --> 17:08.130
<b>Affirmative, boss.</b>

17:08.460 --> 17:10.880
<b>Explain, Par.</b>

17:11.260 --> 17:14.010
<b>Boss, my name is Baltfeld.</b>

17:16.010 --> 17:18.220
<b>Explain, Baltfeld.</b>

17:18.220 --> 17:19.470
<b>Affirmative!</b>

17:19.850 --> 17:22.390
<b>It all started not because of the Empire,</b>

17:22.390 --> 17:25.520
<b>but because of demons who brought 
unknown monsters with them.</b>

17:25.980 --> 17:28.150
<b>We beat them back right away,</b>

17:28.150 --> 17:32.030
<b>but we used up all of our weapons 
to defeat the horde of monsters.</b>

17:32.030 --> 17:34.070
<b>In order to resupply our defenses,</b>

17:34.070 --> 17:37.030
<b>we Haulia had to pull back 
into the settlements.</b>

17:38.070 --> 17:39.870
<b>It was bad timing.</b>

17:39.870 --> 17:42.870
<b>The Empire decided to show up at that moment.</b>

17:42.870 --> 17:47.290
<b>And, their goal wasn't to 
invade, but to kidnap.</b>

17:47.790 --> 17:50.500
<b>We interrogated the imperials 
that we captured.</b>

17:50.500 --> 17:54.970
<b>Apparently, the Empire was also attacked by 
a horde of powerful and unknown monsters.</b>

17:55.470 --> 17:58.050
<b>The imperial capital was 
significantly damaged.</b>

17:59.260 --> 18:06.100
<b>They said they had to replenish 
their supply of labor.</b>

18:06.640 --> 18:09.020
<b>Since you all are involved,</b>

18:09.020 --> 18:11.900
<b>they must have taken rabbit beastmen too,</b>

18:11.900 --> 18:13.480
<b>even though they're not good laborers, right?</b>

18:13.820 --> 18:14.990
<b>Affirmative.</b>

18:15.570 --> 18:16.900
<b>I see.</b>

18:16.900 --> 18:20.820
<b>They claim it's for labor, but they 
clearly have more wretched desires.</b>

18:21.080 --> 18:23.950
<b>Yes. It's sickening.</b>

18:24.540 --> 18:27.540
<b>We weren't going to let 
our brethren be taken,</b>

18:27.540 --> 18:32.710
<b>so the chief himself led a small squad of 
elites to the imperial capital. But...</b>

18:33.420 --> 18:35.300
<b>What happened to Cam?</b>

18:35.880 --> 18:39.180
<b>We lost contact with them when 
they got inside the city.</b>

18:41.600 --> 18:44.720
<b>We're one of the newly 
assembled squads tasked</b>

18:44.720 --> 18:48.270
<b>with finding out what happened to the chief.</b>

18:48.480 --> 18:49.560
<b>I see.</b>

18:50.270 --> 18:53.150
<b>We were gathering intel 
around the imperial capital</b>

18:53.150 --> 18:55.860
<b>when we saw the carriage full of slaves,</b>

18:55.860 --> 18:58.280
<b>so we decided to get them back.</b>

19:05.160 --> 19:06.080
<b>Par.</b>

19:09.210 --> 19:10.330
<b>Baltfeld.</b>

19:10.330 --> 19:11.540
<b>Yes, boss!</b>

19:12.210 --> 19:13.790
<b>You wanna come with us?</b>

19:15.800 --> 19:17.300
<b>Yes, definitely!</b>

19:17.760 --> 19:19.800
<b>Right. Let's head to the Empire!</b>

19:20.340 --> 19:22.260
<b>Sir, yes sir!</b>

19:22.890 --> 19:26.810
<b>H-Hajime-san! Please prioritize 
the Great Labyrinth!</b>

19:26.810 --> 19:29.390
<b>You're worried about Cam 
and the others, right?</b>

19:29.390 --> 19:32.560
<b>Well, I, um...</b>

19:32.980 --> 19:36.780
<b>But I'm sure my father and 
the others will be fine!</b>

19:44.240 --> 19:47.080
<b>Your bunny ears are drooped so far.</b>

19:47.080 --> 19:49.500
<b>Why force yourself to smile?</b>

19:50.000 --> 19:52.750
<b>If you're worried, just say so.</b>

19:53.040 --> 19:54.500
<b>B-But...</b>

19:54.500 --> 19:58.800
<b>No buts. Why be so modest now?</b>

19:59.210 --> 20:01.760
<b>Just say what you feel, like you always do.</b>

20:02.130 --> 20:05.220
<b>What happened to that impudence 
you had when we first met?</b>

20:05.510 --> 20:08.560
<b>Besides, when you're not 
smiling, it makes me...</b>

20:11.310 --> 20:13.770
<b>It makes us feel weird.</b>

20:14.770 --> 20:16.480
<b>Hajime-san.</b>

20:19.650 --> 20:23.160
<b>It might not be too obvious 
to you, but, I...</b>

20:24.200 --> 20:26.450
<b>Well... You know...</b>

20:27.330 --> 20:30.660
<b>You're pretty precious to me.</b>

20:32.040 --> 20:35.960
<b>So, if that's what it takes 
to clear up your worries,</b>

20:35.960 --> 20:39.050
<b>I won't hesitate to use my full force.</b>

20:40.960 --> 20:43.430
<b>Hajime-san, I...</b>

20:43.430 --> 20:48.060
<b>Come on, speak your heart. I'm listening.</b>

20:55.980 --> 20:59.610
<b>I'm worried about my father and the others!</b>

21:00.190 --> 21:03.820
<b>All I want is to see that they're alright!</b>

21:06.700 --> 21:10.410
<b>You should have said that first.</b>

21:10.790 --> 21:13.870
<b>I was startled to see you try to be modest.</b>

21:15.080 --> 21:18.090
<b>I'm not impudent all the time!</b>

21:18.710 --> 21:21.050
<b>Yep. There's the usual Shea.</b>

21:19.550 --> 21:22.670
<b>Come on, Hajime-san! You're so... Come on!</b>

21:21.050 --> 21:25.050
<b>Hmm, perhaps not being berated 
could be good too, sometimes.</b>

21:25.050 --> 21:27.800
<b>Ugh, I'm jealous!</b>

21:39.520 --> 21:40.900
<b>Get in!</b>

21:49.740 --> 21:51.330
<b>We continue tomorrow!</b>

23:34.810 --> 23:37.470
<b>Next episode, "Roar of Revolution".</b>
